{"author":{"id":"2eecc7d99b502c158aacb0868dca9358610edc02724d21fe49b0196402d3364e"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1787774715,"nonce":"CEXBZygTOPxJggUoRRnf1M5XRn4=","title":"feat(ui): dashboard redesign — visited status cards, ⌘K, identity, Space Grotesk","message":"\u003e Imported from pull request #26 (MERGED)\n\u003e Branch: `feat/dashboard-redesign` → `main`\n\u003e Created: 2026-07-18T05:26:07Z · Merged: 2026-07-18T06:07:02Z\n\nRebuilds the dashboard around real recency signals, adds two global surfaces (⌘K palette, identity menu), and the backend endpoints they need — built for real, tested against fakes.\n\n- **Collapses the flat activity table into the repo grid.** Recency now lives on the cards.\n- **Recently-visited status cards** — browser-local (`localStorage`, written on `RepoView` mount; falls back to most-active when empty), each with a rounded **red/green pass-fail bar strip** of the repo's last runs.\n- **Full repo list**, most-recently-active first, with a **filter box** for orgs with many repos.\n- Keeps the **action inbox** (runs suspended on a gate).\n\n- **⌘K command palette** — fuzzy repo search + jump-to-run by id.\n- **Real avatar + identity menu** backed by `GET /v1/me` (name, subject, role, sign-out).\n\n| Endpoint / field | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `GET /v1/me` | the authenticated principal (dev = synthetic Owner) |\n| `GET /v1/repos/{org}/{repo}/runs` | tenant-scoped run history (chart source) |\n| `ProjectDto.last_run_at` | recency ordering for `GET /v1/repos` |\n| `DbPort::list_runs_for_tenant` | Postgres + testkit impls |\n\nRegenerated `openapi.json` + the TS client (ADR-0054 drift gate). New `tests/dashboard.rs` (3 tests) plus the existing route-coverage test pass; full `scarab-server` + `scarab-engine` suites green.\n\n- **Replaces Major Mono Display with Space Grotesk** across both UIs.\n- **README**: theme-aware dashboard + run-view screenshots, badges, and a Documentation section linking the GitHub Pages site.\n- **Docs site**: real dashboard + run screenshots (drops the placeholder).\n\nDashboard (light) — action inbox, visited status cards, recency-sorted repo list:\n\n![dashboard](docs/assets/screenshots/dashboard-light.jpg)\n\nRun view — DAG, live logs, event timeline (a retried step, then suspended on a manual gate):\n\n![run detail](docs/assets/screenshots/run-detail-light.jpg)\n\n`ProjectDto` sorts by `last_run_at` only — the `Project` domain has no push/created_at, so never-run repos sort alphabetically. Sorting by **latest push** needs forge metadata we don't persist yet (tracked in git-bug `4aa3b1b`).\n\nCloses (git-bug): `cbd1a43` `46d5750` `4aa3b1b` `e2d8f02` `6494032` `f79277e`\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","files":null}]}